&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to shape the global marketing strategy for our most critical partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a world-class team driving innovation in experience management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation and strategic career development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chance to work at the intersection of global technology partnerships and innovative marketing&lt;/li&gt;
