&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why We Have This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We’re hiring an Enterprise Account Executive based in Sydney to win net-new enterprise customers and expand strategic relationships across our territory. You’ll help world-leading organisations improve customer and employee experiences with Qualtrics’ 360° XM platform. Working with senior leaders at client organisations and with internal teams (solutions consultants, customer success, marketing, legal and sales ops), you’ll lead complex sales cycles that meaningfully grow revenue and market presence.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Find Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
