&lt;li&gt;Experience engaging leaders in market research, marketing, HR or related enterprise functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with Salesforce.com (or equivalent CRM) and disciplined sales process management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in MarTech or HR Tech strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent professional experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
