&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Logo Account Executive Sales Leader&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Why We Have This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Qualtrics New Logo Sales drives top-line revenue growth by winning new enterprise customers to our insights subscriptions and bespoke engagements. We empower prospective clients to make confident decisions through our experience platform and unique data capabilities. We are seeking a seasoned North America Sales Leader to lead net-new customer acquisition, expand market share, and establish foundational enterprise partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;How You’ll Find Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;Drive new business ARR growth by leveraging SaaS, DaaS, and Generative AI offerings to achieve 50%+ annual growth across net-new accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;Execute go-to-market strategies focused on target market penetration, ideal customer profile (ICP) acquisition, and outmaneuvering competitors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot;&gt;Demonstrate a proven ability to source, negotiate, and close net-new, seven-figure contracts with complex enterprise buyers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot;&gt;Cultivate a high-performing hunter sales culture that emphasizes pipeline velocity, value proposition framing, and executive alignment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4,0&quot;&gt;Exhibit strong commercial acumen in net-new deal structuring, land-and-expand strategies, pricing models, and fast-paced contract negotiations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;How You’ll Grow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;Scale high-impact new-logo acquisition initiatives with executive exposure that directly drive core top-line ARR expansion goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;Act as a key thought partner in converting emerging prospect needs into new AI and experience management go-to-market offerings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
