&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Enterprise Sales Manager - DACH&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why We Have This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Qualtrics is hiring a proactive individual to lead one of our Strategic Enterprise Sales teams in Germany. In this role, your primary focus will be on leading the team to success, with a focus on coaching and mentoring as well as driving net new revenue for Qualtrics. Our Sales team is a group of highly driven individuals dedicated to closing experience gaps. Our SaaS platform is used to help some of the largest organizations in the world drive action with pre-built experience management (XM) programs and projects that anyone can use. The ideal candidate would be someone who is results driven, and has a strong operating rhythm. Adaptability, leading with empathy, and a positive approach will be paramount.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Find Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relationship Building: Master stakeholder mapping to cultivate relationships with multiple contacts within an account, ensuring lasting partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiation Skills: Navigate negotiations with professionalism, understanding the art of give-and-take.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-Selling Approach: Drive engagement with various business stakeholders in parallel to create multifaceted selling opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathetic Competitiveness: While being competitive, possess the ability to empathize and understand others’ perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial Mindset: Take initiative to grasp the expected outcomes and context, working independently to drive results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective Communication: Influence effectively at all levels, creating trust and collaboration within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Grow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;By joining Qualtrics, you become part of a team that dares to pursue groundbreaking experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our mission is to build technology that positively impacts businesses and makes them more human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a member of our global sales organization, you will take ownership of a dedicated team. Your responsibilities will include developing a robust team strategy designed to drive demand and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We encourage big-picture thinking and foster an environment that embraces innovation and creativity. You will build relationships with multiple decision makers in an account and educate them on the value of Qualtrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of Strategic Account Executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coaching direct reports in sales strategy, pipeline management, opportunity management, and career planning/development.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operating rhythm is a critical success factor for this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, retain, and nurture your team of experienced strategic ales professionals with high potential and strong performance history.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide skill training and mentoring on complex sales motions, including collaboration with legal, product presentations, juggling multiple relationships with internal teams, and quarterly sales forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface and develop professional relationships with existing clients and prospects throughout at all levels of an organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Display a systemic approach to handling meaningful contract negotiations/deals with multiple reps at a time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain in-depth knowledge of Qualtrics&#39; solution offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a real-time understanding of the competitive landscape to assist in building win-based proposals and pricing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as an executive sponsor during complex deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a real-time understanding of the competitive landscape to assist in determining win-based proposals and pricing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain positive relationships with other functional areas internally at Qualtrics, e.g., Professional Services, Implementation, Subject Matter Experts, etc, to ensure a collaborative approach to secure large enterprise engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate experience successfully managing through change in a fast-growing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial approach to effectively managing a business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For On Your Resume&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A validated winner that has led teams to breakthrough results. Strong track record closing and/or managing multi-million deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 6-8 years of individual enterprise-level sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 4-5 years managing a sales team to achieve great results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SaaS selling experience with long, complex sales cycles and multi-stakeholder negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Record of over-exceeding quarterly team quotas through metric based skill development and internal team management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and understanding of working on complex contract negotiations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using MEDDIC sales processes, or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Salesforce.com and measuring system compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are open to travel up to once/twice a month&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice-to-haves
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in CX, Experience Management (XM), market research, analytics, or related enterprise SaaS solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to automotive, manufacturing, utilities, financial services, or public sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience at scale-ups or hypergrowth SaaS companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Should Know About This Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We work with a team of highly motivated, ambitious individuals. Keeping that energy and spirit alive is critical, while balancing an expectation of meritocracy as it pertains to performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our customer satisfaction rate is incredibly high and a point of pride for our teams. Identifying ways to continue to delight stakeholders is key.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating space and encouraging/ expecting innovation to come from different areas of the team is critical to our team’s and company’s growth and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The day-to-day in this role is dynamic and fast paced - the ability to prioritize and focus is critical to success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
