&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Product Management - Text Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Why We Have This Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Text is where our customers&#39; most valuable insights live, and this role sits at the absolute center of how we unlock them. You will lead the strategy and execution to evolve our mature, highly adopted text analysis engine from classical ML/rules-based structures into a cutting-edge hybrid architecture that leverages LLMs for enterprise scale. Leading a dedicated team of product managers and partnering deeply with applied science and engineering, you will directly influence how over 18,000 global clients understand open-ended feedback, conversations, and unstructured data across the entire Qualtrics ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;How You’ll Find Success&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Balances Innovation with Pragmatism:&lt;/strong&gt; Possesses excellent judgment on when to deploy classical ML, LLMs, or hybrid solutions based on cost, latency, accuracy, and explainability.&lt;/p&gt;
