&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Leads and Empowers:&lt;/strong&gt; Coaches, mentors, and builds high-performing product managers, holding the team accountable to clear outcomes while fostering their career growth.&lt;/p&gt;
