&lt;li&gt;Group Life &amp;amp; Income Protection Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Glasses/Contact lenses Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free breakfasts, lunches, snacks, and drinks for everyone in the office&lt;/li&gt;
