&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success owning and delivering complex backend services in a production environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software development skills with production experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to design scalable, low-latency, distributed data processing systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring others and influencing engineering practices and decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of identifying and reducing technical debt and operational risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud-native infrastructure, CI/CD pipelines, and automated testing frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
