&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why We Have This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Qualtrics is looking for an energetic and self-motivated individual to join our Finance team. We are a goal-oriented team that works hard and enjoys the incredible trajectory that Qualtrics provides. This is a job for a well-spoken, hard-working, self-starting individual with excellent social skills. You will work with the sales team, the finance team, and taxing jurisdictions around the world. If you enjoy working in a fast-paced environment, this job is a good fit for you.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Find Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll display organizational and time management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are highly communicative and can effectively influence others, building trust within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an ability to work through issues and be proactive to find the solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a trusted resource for business partners, able to resolve complex problems effectively and efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll build trust within in the team, with a strong ability to work in a team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Grow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role is built for someone looking to gain experience in multiple areas of tax&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will also learn the skills to solve complex problems in any area of tax&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop continued expertise in multiple areas of tax&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
