&lt;li&gt;Manage the unclaimed property process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete routine business and tax related filings with various states, counties, and cities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete month and quarter close account reconciliations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with various projects and audit requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously look for ways to improve processes, increase efficiencies, utilize AI, and improve the quality of the team’s work product&lt;/li&gt;
