&lt;li&gt;Sales tax and/or VAT experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organizational and time management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with ambiguity and change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
